* text=auto eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf

# The four bound inputs are hashed byte-for-byte by supplement_analysis.py against
# input_bindings.json. Any `text`/`eol` filtering normalises CRLF to LF in the
# repository and in every clone, changing their SHA-256 and breaking the binding.
# `eol` must be unset as well as `text`, because setting `eol` implies text
# conversion even when `text` is unset. Store these four files exactly as reviewed.
*.csv -text -eol
*.json -text -eol
